\newlabel{fig:raw_twim}{{28a}{71}{Raw, uncalibrated $\Delta E$ distributions from all 16 TWIN anodes recorded during the thick-target run at 550~AMeV. Upstream anodes are shown in color, downstream in gray. No charge selection (R3B MUSIC) or position cut (MWPC0) was applied, leading to the extended high-energy tail from pileup events. The cut-off at 8192~a.u.\ marks the digitizer’s dynamic range, while the drop around 1500~a.u.\ stems from electronic thresholds. The last six anodes have a slightly different amplification. \relax }{figure.caption.32}{}}
\newlabel{fig:raw_twim@cref}{{[subfigure][1][28]28a}{[1][67][]71}}
